# Task Manager App

A simple and efficient Task Manager application built using JavaScript that allows users to add, view, and manage daily tasks. This project focuses on clean UI, DOM manipulation, and basic state management.

## 🚀 Features
- Add new tasks
- Display tasks dynamically
- Remove tasks on click
- Clean and user-friendly interface
- Responsive layout

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript (Vanilla JS)
- DOM Manipulation

